        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2003 SEC Championship Game\n- Teams: LSU Tigers, Georgia Bulldogs\n- Places: Georgia Dome, Atlanta, Georgia, Vine City, downtown Atlanta\n- Organizations: State of Georgia, Georgia World Congress Center Authority\n\nFacts:\n- The 2003 SEC Championship Game was won by the LSU Tigers, who defeated the Georgia Bulldogs 34–13.\n- The 2003 SEC Championship Game was played in the Georgia Dome in Atlanta, Georgia.\n- The Georgia Dome was located in Atlanta, Georgia, between downtown to the east and Vine City to the west.\n- The Georgia Dome was owned and operated by the State of Georgia as part of the Georgia World Congress Center Authority.",
